  "bodyHash": "8e9e41a9c5d16944",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/796/666/project_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"690\">                                                                                                                                        </p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ChickenBlock 是一个主要专注于资源鸡、Create（机械动力）以及天堂模组的整合包，所有玩法均设定在空岛环境中。</strong></h1><hr><pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这个整合包的主要目标是获得一块<strong>基岩</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">。</span><img style=\"color:#b2b2b2;font-family:sans-serif\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/966856/description_c4a01ea3-7f64-4ceb-8c45-28ed32565d06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"94\"></pre><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">我们在如何获取每种鸡的繁殖品种上进行了深思熟虑和精心策划。在某些情况下，这并不是简单地让两只鸡交配那么简单……你需要跳出思维定势，利用一些 Create 模组中的机械装置和其他技巧。</span></p><p><img style=\"font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/966856/description_58f3b0a7-2624-4e32-ad3e-25c45e2bc436.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"93\" height=\"97\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">核心理念是收集并使用资源鸡，在一个几乎一无所有的世界中生存下去……</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这里有许多任务来保持你毛茸茸的双脚站稳脚跟，所有内容分为四个章节（Act）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">在任务书中，你还会发现一个商店，使用金币作为货币。</span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/966856/description_5adfc2d2-1e44-460f-8e50-11e2865585be.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"91\" height=\"96\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这些金币可以通过完成任务获得，但也可能有其他方式获取它们。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/966856/description_80c9590d-42ce-4fd1-9d86-496fa13ecf9b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"100\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">整合包中的天堂（The Aether）部分旨在通过探索、Boss战、资源、鸡种以及怀旧元素为整合包增添多样性！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">视频展示：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yBEXQvdPkt8?t\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我为这个整合包自己制作了一些模组，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-beans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Beans</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherstar-shard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Netherstar Shard</a>，但如果没有其他开发者的支持，这个整合包是不可能实现的。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所以，谢谢大家！</span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐔</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组列表：</span></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jeitweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEITweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-compressed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Compressed (by nocubeyt)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-pus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bedrock Plus (by anvian)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placebo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placebo (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Chunks (Forge) (by FTB)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Library (Forge) (by FTB)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollow\">AttributeFix (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skin Layers 3D (Fabric/Forge) (by tr7zw)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rubidium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rubidium (by Asek3)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Crafts &amp; Additions (by MRHminer)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-leaf-decay\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Leaf Decay (by olafskiii)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafting-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafting Tweaks (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-enhanced-extinguishing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Addon: Enhanced Extinguishing (by TheAetherTeam)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-beans\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Beans (by DanRobzProbz)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/openblocks-elevator\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenBlocks Elevator (by vsngarcia)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libx\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibX (by noeppinoeppi)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherstar-shard\" rel=\"nofollow\">Netherstar Shard (by DanRobzProbz)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">PackMenu (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/titanium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Titanium (by Buuz135)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafting-station\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafting Station (by tfarecnim)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/in-control\" rel=\"nofollow\">In Control! (by McJty)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI (by EmilyPloszaj)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-jetpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Jetpacks (by BlakeBr0)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clumps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clumps (by Jaredlll08)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux (by Zepalesque)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease\" rel=\"nofollow\">Harvest with ease (by CrystalSpider)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modernfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModernFix (by embeddedt)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS (by LatvianModder)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether (by TeamRazor)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin (by squeek502)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Item Filters (by LatvianModder)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chargers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chargers (by GoryMoon)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resource-chickens\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resource Chickens (by WallyWhip)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-hopper\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wooden Hopper (by thecech12)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Crafting (by BlakeBr0)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create (by simibubi)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createtweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreateTweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyblock-builder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyblock Builder (by MelanX)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge) (by shedaniel)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling (by Jaredlll08)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidtotem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Void Totem (Forge) (by Affehund)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cucumber\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cucumber Library (by BlakeBr0)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-sound-muffler\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extreme sound muffler (Forge) (by LeoBeliik)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rhino\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rhino (by LatvianModder)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks (by YaLTeR)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations (by tr7zw)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-sorter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Sorter (by cpw)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (by mezz)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat (by FTB)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structure-gel-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structure Gel API (by ModdingLegacy)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling Fabric/Forge (by tr7zw)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender (Forge) (by TheAdubbz)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spice-of-life-carrot-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spice of Life: Carrot Edition (by lordcazsius)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm (Forge Edition) (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-steam-n-rails